' ------------------------------------------------------------
' 🎨 File: style.puml (Dark Theme — Corporate Palette v6, CI-Friendly)
' ------------------------------------------------------------
' 📌 Purpose   : Dark theme style with refined palette (clear contrasts)
' 🧱 Layer     : Docs / UML Config
' 👤 Author    : Mohamed Ali
' 🗓️ Updated   : 2025-08-28
'
' 🧠 Palette (User-defined v6):
' - #EB1B00 → Notes / Errors
' - #1F00EB → Containers
' - #E0C200 → Database (soft yellow, better contrast)
' - #00CE6A → Actors (Users)
' - #F861FF → Infra / Packages
' - #FF6F5C → Components / Classes
' - #604CE0 → Arrows (Flows)
' - #4BE3FE → Activity
' - #246947 → Secondary Highlight / Lifelines
' ------------------------------------------------------------

